@* A button that opens the site's agent (F164.2): one of the theme's quiet buttons, the chat opened through the door
   with nothing asked, and its keys, Ctrl+I or Cmd+I, said to a screen reader and held by its module. *@
<button type="button" class="btn btn-line" aria-keyshortcuts="Control+I Meta+I" @ref="_button"
        @onclick="OpenChat">@Text</button>
